From 7ac155d3dd53500df142eeb827b22f5ee798f509 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego Pivoto <>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:06:24 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(e2): control OAI PRB quotas with experimental SF
 profile

Carry the experimental E2SM-SF/0.1 text profile inside DL slice labels of
FlexRIC's custom SLICE SM: control requests apply or roll back quotas and
indications read back the live rules, latest outcomes, per-UE quota and
scheduler counters (5 Hz, or on the next tick after a new outcome). Remote
input never asserts; defects become REJECTED_* outcomes. The mono-gNB RAN
function target swaps the random-data SLICE stub for this adapter.
